Monitor and manage HPE Networking Instant On switches, access points and
Wi-Fi networks from the OPNsense web interface.

* Switches (1930/1960, local management): ports, PoE, VLANs, LLDP, MAC
  table, health and log; port, VLAN and configuration changes with
  safeguards for the link to the firewall.
* Access points: status, uplink, clients, firmware and restarts from
  their local diagnostic page.
* Optional Instant On cloud account: wireless client details, alerts and
  Wi-Fi network management.
* Clients correlated with ARP, DHCP leases and static mappings; health
  checks and events sent to syslog.

No telemetry. The only connections outside the local network go to the
HPE Instant On cloud, and only when a cloud account is configured.

